<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Senate gives 2nd approval to decree bill.</title>
<headline>Brazil Senate gives 2nd approval to decree bill.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Senate approved for a second time a constitutional amendment which changes the rules for the use of presidential decrees, an official said.</p>
<p>The bill, which was approved 57-12 on the floor of the upper house with one abstention, now goes to the Chamber of Deputies where it also requires two three-fifths majorities.</p>
</text>
